          <fieldset>
            <legend>2. Which of these languages are commonly used for systems programming?</legend>
            <div class="choice-list">
              <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q2" value="C"><span class="choice-text">C</span></label>
              <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="q2" value="Rust"><span class="choice-text">Rust</span></label>
